# GitLab delivery

- Reuse central Reva templates and preserve child-pipeline variables, rules:changes, artifacts, reports, scans, and environment gates.
- Pin external includes/images immutably where required; do not expose protected variables or echo credentials.
- Tests and build tools enforce quality; coverage regex/widgets only report. Preserve rollback and never rewrite historical release pins.
